    "spoilerEvidence": "Emma’s one-star review initially points towards H.G. Kane as the person behind her nightmare. However, Kane is revealed to be Howard Grosvenor Kline, who physically attacks Emma. The real mastermind is Deek, her seemingly helpful neighbour, who orchestrated the events and used Howard to carry out his plan. The manuscript and Deek’s suspicious behaviour take on a new meaning once his involvement is exposed.",
